  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity IRICs (Appraisal &amp; Design) is a component of Strategic advice in response to GoI requests &#x2013; and development of next phase of urban policy engagement &amp; programming (e.g. Inclusive Resilient Indian Cities) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;238,130. It works in the following sector(s): Urban development and management, Energy generation, renewable sources - multiple technologies, Energy policy and administrative management, Public finance management (PFM).</narrative>
  </description>
